# CVE-2026-112366 - picomatch ReDoS via single-branch repeated extglobs.
# Affects every picomatch release through 4.0.7; no patched version exists
# upstream yet (https://advisories.gitlab.com/npm/picomatch/CVE-2026-112366/).
# picomatch here is a transitive build-time dependency of the documentation
# site's Docusaurus toolchain (pulled in via micromatch/chokidar and similar
# glob-matching libs). It only evaluates glob patterns we author ourselves in
# build config, never attacker-supplied input, so the ReDoS is not reachable
# through this repo. Remove this line once a fixed release is published.
CVE-2026-112366
